}

@aboutme_fixed_nuxt path /app /app/* /authorize /authorize/* /authorize.md /forgot-password /forgot-password/* /forgot-password.md /_nuxt /_nuxt/* /login /login/* /login.md /register /register/* /register.md /reset-password /reset-password/* /reset-password.md /verify-email /verify-email/* /verify-email.md
